{"seq":6,"slug":"signal-integrity","title":"信号完整性","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.08,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 信号完整性（Signal Integrity）\n\n信号完整性是高速电子系统设计中的核心学科，研究电信号在互连结构中传输时的质量保持问题。随着数字系统数据速率突破数十 Gbps，信号上升时间缩短至皮秒级别，PCB 走线不再是简单的导线，而是必须按照传输线理论进行精确设计的电磁结构。\n\n本 Hub 系统性地覆盖信号完整性的四大支柱：传输线理论基础、串扰与电磁干扰、高速接口设计实践，以及测量与仿真技术。从基础物理模型出发，逐步深入到 DDR5、SerDes 等前沿应用场景，帮助读者建立完整的信号完整性分析能力。\n\n## 知识体系结构\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[信号完整性] --> B[传输线理论]\n    A --> C[串扰与EMI]\n    A --> D[高速接口设计]\n    A --> E[测量与仿真]\n    B --> B1[传输线模型与特征阻抗]\n    B --> B2[反射与阻抗匹配]\n    B --> B3[有损传输线分析]\n    C --> C1[串扰机理与耦合]\n    C --> C2[EMI源与传播路径]\n    C --> C3[屏蔽与滤波设计]\n    D --> D1[DDR信号完整性]\n    D --> D2[SerDes高速串行链路]\n    D --> D3[眼图分析与均衡]\n    E --> E1[TDR/VNA测量]\n    E --> E2[S参数网络分析]\n    E --> E3[SI仿真工具]\n```\n\n## 适用读者\n\n具备基础电路理论知识，希望深入理解高速 PCB 设计中信号质量问题的硬件工程师、系统架构师和电子工程专业学习者。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 电磁场与电磁波基础\n- 模拟电路与数字电路原理\n- 基本 PCB 设计概念\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transmission-line-theory","title":"传输线理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transmission-line-model","title":"传输线模型与特征阻抗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/transmission-line-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reflection-matching","title":"反射与阻抗匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/reflection-matching"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lossy-line-analysis","title":"有损传输线分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/lossy-line-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"crosstalk-emi","title":"串扰与电磁干扰","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crosstalk-mechanisms","title":"串扰机理与耦合模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/crosstalk-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emi-sources-paths","title":"EMI 源与传播路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/emi-sources-paths"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shielding-filtering-design","title":"屏蔽与滤波设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/shielding-filtering-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-speed-design","title":"高速接口设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddr-signal-integrity","title":"DDR 信号完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/ddr-signal-integrity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serdes-high-speed-serial","title":"SerDes 与高速串行链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/serdes-high-speed-serial"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eye-diagram-equalization","title":"眼图分析与均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/eye-diagram-equalization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"measurement-techniques","title":"测量与仿真技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tdr-vna-principles","title":"TDR/VNA 测量原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques/tdr-vna-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"s-parameters-analysis","title":"S 参数与网络分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques/s-parameters-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"si-simulation-tools","title":"信号完整性仿真工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/measurement-techniques/si-simulation-tools"}]}]}